@startuml
title Stage Execution Sequence - StageCallableContract Boundary
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam roundcorner 0

participant "Consuming Workflow / Root" as CW
participant "StageCallableContract" as SCC
participant "Stage Composition" as SComp
participant "Stage[TStagePayload]" as Stage
participant "StageResult[TStagePayload]" as SRes

CW -> SCC : StageInvocation
(input, execution context, correlation)
SCC -> SComp : coordinate Step instances
SComp -> Stage : invoke Steps through public contracts
Stage --> SComp : collect Step results
SComp --> SCC : assemble Stage Flow Result
SCC --> SRes : StageResult envelope
(outputs slot, flow result slot,
domain outcome slot, diagnostics)
SRes --> CW : return Stage result

note right of CW : StageCallableContract = public boundary
StageAggregate owns Step membership & flow semantics
StageResult distinct from StepExecutionResult
Prefect State != domain result

@enduml